    "description": "<p>The caster tests Will against the target's Will.</p><p><strong>On success:</strong> the target is trapped in an impenetrable illusion and perceives nothing of reality until the caster releases it, or it frees itself on a retest once every ten days.</p><p><strong>On failure:</strong> the target is Disoriented for three rounds and takes {{math spellPower \"*\" 3}} damage, which can incapacitate but never kill.</p>",
